{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/db9f4373d06391628e37cf12859e65f7.poster.avif?t=1774884346\" width=1080 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/db9f4373d06391628e37cf12859e65f7.webm?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/db9f4373d06391628e37cf12859e65f7.mp4?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge <strong>OpenWorld</strong> to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons\u00a0<strong>differ in attack patterns and playstyle</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>classes and spells</strong> from an ever-growing spell tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full character <strong>customizations</strong>, hair combinations, <strong>vanity slots</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore find and fight bosses to <strong>craft the best equipment, included vanity slot</strong> to individualize your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon <strong>progression crafting tree</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon <strong>slot upgrade system</strong> with playstyle individualization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World is sandbox, <strong>build and settle anywhere, set up farms, structures and decorations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transformable</strong> terrain\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible battlefield, <strong>you destroy environment and so does Bosses</strong>, but everything will regrow overtime</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XBOX Controller Support</strong>: Utilize twin stick playstyle, or traditional top-down joypad style with auto-aiming support toggle. (auto-aim works with mouse and keyboard playstyle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by <strong>Dale North</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/56c80cfdbc58e789927aed3d9db6a9e7.poster.avif?t=1774884346\" width=1080 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/56c80cfdbc58e789927aed3d9db6a9e7.webm?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/56c80cfdbc58e789927aed3d9db6a9e7.mp4?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure in a vast, open world  crafting game where the power of magic is yours to wield. Collect and craft new spells as you explore the world, discovering rare and valuable items to aid you in your journey. Battle unique bosses and expand your base and individualize your settlement. With endless possibilities for customization and exploration, every playthrough is a unique and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/676debb1957197b937dd60f20a3403c8.poster.avif?t=1774884346\" width=1080 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/676debb1957197b937dd60f20a3403c8.webm?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta