growing spell tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full character <strong>customizations</strong>, hair combinations, <strong>vanity slots</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore find and fight bosses to <strong>craft the best equipment, included vanity slot</strong> to individualize your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon <strong>progression crafting tree</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon <strong>slot upgrade system</strong> with playstyle individualization</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World is sandbox, <strong>build and settle anywhere, set up farms, structures and decorations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transformable</strong> terrain\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible battlefield, <strong>you destroy environment and so does Bosses</strong>, but everything will regrow overtime</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XBOX Controller Support</strong>: Utilize twin stick playstyle, or traditional top-down joypad style with auto-aiming support toggle. (auto-aim works with mouse and keyboard playstyle)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by <strong>Dale North</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/56c80cfdbc58e789927aed3d9db6a9e7.poster.avif?t=1774884346\" width=1080 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/56c80cfdbc58e789927aed3d9db6a9e7.webm?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/extras/56c80cfdbc58e789927aed3d9db6a9e7.mp4?t=1774884346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph